  "update_count": 53,
  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \nA sandboxed iframe is not supposed to be able to initiate a download unless the \"allow-downloads\" flag is set. However, it is possible to make the user click on the \"Download\" option of the audio player through a clickjacking attack, which ends up downloading a file."
}